1. When the external pressure P3 is below the nozzle exit pressure P2, the nozzle will flow full but will have external expansion waves at its exit (i.e., under-expansion). The expansion of the gas inside the nozzle is incomplete and the value of CF and I~, will be less than at optimum expansion.


